<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Aristocrat share trading suspended.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Aristocrat share trading suspended.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of gaming machine maker Aristocrat Leisure Ltd have been suspended pending an announcement on an application for a gaming licence in the United States, the Australian Stock Exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
